## Pipeline recap

```
PR → main    ─▶ test (matrix) ─┐
                lint ──────────┤
                schema-check ──┘   (all must pass before merge)

push → main  ─▶ test/lint/schema-check ─▶ build (GHCR) ─▶ deploy prod ─▶ ✅
                                                                  ╲
                                                                   notify Slack

push → staging ─▶ test/lint/schema-check ─▶ build (GHCR) ─▶ deploy-staging
```

Everything is version-pinned, gated by branch protection, kept up to date by Dependabot, and deployed with zero downtime through Kamal.

